  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "On any spin, 3 or more          triggers Mystery Wheel Feature.\r\nWhen
      triggered, reels expand to 4x5 and 2 lowest symbols are removed from the Wheel
      Strip.\r\nThen, whenever one or more          added on new row, expand reels
      by one row and remove 2 lowest symbols from the Wheel Strip.\r\nIf the reel
      set is 7x5 or no extra          appears, then start to spin the Wheel.\r\nEvery
      \         is replaced with the symbol from the Wheel. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: '1 or more                 that appears in newly expanded zone will

      continue to expand reels by 1 to high up to 5x7

      Once reel format is on maximum 5x7 no new                 will appear

      With each new expand two lowvalue symbols are droped from

      strip of wheel of symbols

      Wheel of symbols spin once to reveal replace symbol for all'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "               is available only during Free Games.\r\nCollect                 to
